  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Santosh S/O. Keshavrao Lawate vs The State Of Maharashtra on 5 September, 2019 Author: V. K. Jadhav Bench: V. K. Jadhav ba954.19 -1- In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 13 Bail Application No.954 Of 2019 Santosh S/O. Keshavrao Lawate Versus The State Of Maharashtra ..... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Kuldip S. Kahalekar h/f Mr. N.S. Ghanekar App for Respondents: Mr. R.V. Dasalkar ..... Coram : V. K. Jadhav, J. Dated : 5 th September, 2019 Per Court:- 1.",
    "facts": "On going through the allegations made in the complaint and on Santosh S/O. Keshavrao Lawate vs The State Of Maharashtra on 5 September, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/185118626/ 1 perusal of investigation papers, it appears that the applicant caught red-handed alongwith contraband articles on 20.6.2019. The contraband articles worth Rs.16,210/- came to be seized from his possession. It further appears that so far as the present applicant is ::: Uploaded on - 05/09/2019 ::: Downloaded on - 06/09/2019 05:33:5 ba954.19 -2- concerned, the investigation is over for all practical purpose and the only formality of filing charge sheet is remained. The applicant has a fixed place of residence at Vishrantinagar, Mukundwadi Railway Station area, Aurangabad. Learned A.P.P. has also verified the same through the investigating officer.",
